},{"spoiler":false,"text":"芸名は“天津りさ”。人気絶頂のアイドルユニット 『デートコース』のリードボーカル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だがひとたびアイドルの仮面を脱げば、その素顔は主人公の“隣のお姉さん”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本当は主人公のことを甘やかせてあげたいのに、口を開けば顎で使ってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"素直になれないお姉さんだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「貴之は、わたしのいうことだけ聞いていればいいの！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16267","sourceWorkId":"11557","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"比主人公大一岁的青梅竹马，励学馆学园3年A组。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"艺名是天津りさ。担任偶像组合『Date Course』的主唱，目前的人气与组合同样都是最旺的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"然而一旦脱去偶像的面具，本来面目对主人公来说就是“邻居的大姐姐”，从前如是，如今仍然如是。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"其实明明想疼主人公的，一旦开口就变成了颐指气使。没法对自己坦率的大姐姐。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12148"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16267","sourceWorkId":"11557","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"d","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16267","sourceWorkId":"11557","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"164 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16267","sourceWorkId":"11557","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16267","sourceWorkId":"11557","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16267","sourceWorkId":"11557","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/3776b987ca31a8f5fc864493b7d0e9236b2da4b95930d002775d133c1c386e01.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/26e8923c55cddc102a41548a25f205ebae30c813ba4aff73e153b184e415ff2b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"民安ともえ","creatorId":"vndb:s23","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s23","canonicalEntityId